---
// biome-ignore-all lint/correctness/noUnusedImports: the template uses each import, and Biome 2.5.15 reads the frontmatter only
// The lockup replaces Starlight's title (brand spec 11). It links where
// Starlight's title links. The template reads the route in place: Biome 2.5.15
// lints this frontmatter and not the template, so a const reads as unused.
// The span keeps translate="no" of Starlight's title, so a page translator
// leaves the name as it is.
import Lockup from "../Lockup.astro";
---
<span class="at-site-title" translate="no"><Lockup href={Astro.locals.starlightRoute.siteTitleHref} beat /></span>
